  m_text: "The Thebrean people arrived a few hundred years after the two native peoples
    of Streynia had established the land. Originally thought of as invaders, they
    settled in the coastal areas of the country and focused on building an infrastructure
    of commerce and international trade. They built up wealth through these practices
    and utilized it primarily to support the improvement of educational and medical
    infrastructure within Streynia during the time of industrialization. \n"
