      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A copy of the ceasefire agreement that was signed by the political leaders
    (at the time) of each of the 3 groups. The agreement detailed that the country
    would be governed by a representative of each of the three groups for a few decades,
    to fix the damages incurred and to stabilize public outrage. It marked the end
    of the civil war, and the dawn of a new era in the country of Streynia. \r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
